{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of Hadvoron</strong> is a fast paced Third Person Action Roguelike playable by yourself or with a team made of up to 4 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>The Godhunters</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of the 10+ available <strong>Godhunters</strong>, each one with a different passive and three unique skills.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Unique Builds</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become as powerful as ever with a system of infinitely stackable bonuses thanks to the Passive Item system, create mayhem while slaying as many enemies as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 50 Activable Items acting like new skills for the playable characters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>High Replayability</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the <strong>Guardian's</strong> statue hidden in the stages (more than 20 stages) or fullfill the required objective to fight powerful Bosses and test your skill and your build.<br><br><br>Unlock new Items that can be found in each run or find new weapons for the\u00a0<strong>Godhunters</strong>\u00a0that change the playstyle of that character, increasing the replayability of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744440/extras/ab1faf50d127b17923ea6a65b5eb3828.poster.avif?t=1756935156\" width=620 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744440/extras/ab1faf50d127b17923ea6a65b5eb3828.webm?t=1756935156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744440/extras/ab1faf50d127b17923ea6a65b5eb3828.mp4?t=1756935156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>The Beauty Of Handcrafted Worlds Meets the Variety of Roguelites<i>\u00a0</i></u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted stages that change both in lighting and shape in real time based on the everchanging Gods' Influence, the Gods fight over which one controls the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744440?t=1756935156","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744440?t=1756935156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744440/add629418584b6d8719aecddf4bd0b3d24b86d59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756935156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744440/add629418584b6d8719aecddf4bd0b3d24b86d59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756935156","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ruins of Hadvoron</strong> is a 